Purpose: When an OU is locked into lifecycle, we generate a Problem Statement (PS) bound 1:1 to that 
OU instance, identified by (ou_id, pipeline_run_id). This section defines the minimal schema and 
reconciliation flow for PS while keeping full traceability.

